            [ 'Can I reduce my net investment income tax?', 'Yes — tax-loss harvesting, spreading large asset sales across multiple years, maximizing pre-tax retirement contributions to lower MAGI, and holding tax-exempt municipal bonds can all reduce NIIT exposure. A CPA can help model which strategies fit your specific income situation.' ],
